	(descr "0402 (1005 metric, 1.0 x 0.5 mm) MLCC GRM155 / CL05. Land per Murata JEMCG0-2701K 'Soldering and Mounting / (2) Land Dimensions', Table 2 Reflow Soldering Method (a = gap between lands, b = land length, c = land width), printed in every GRM spec sheet, here GRM21BR71C106KE51L spec p32 (LCSC C408142, p23/merge/od/dl/murata/grm21_c408142.pdf). GR*15 row: a 0.30-0.50, b 0.35-0.45, c 0.40-0.60. Chosen a 0.40, b 0.45, c 0.55: lands 0.45 x 0.55 at +-0.425 (1.30 x 0.55 = budget envelope '0402'; same land as lib:R_0402_1005Metric). Samsung CL05 parts share the EIA 0402 chip format.. Corrected copy of OpenDrone:C_0402_1005Metric (same frame), F.Fab body, no component silk; spec hardware/tools/land_specs/C_0402_1005Metric_W.json")
